 r←testExportArrowBytes;r;req;db;con;bytes;rows
⎕CS ##
⍝ Test in-memory Arrow IPC export (for plot WebSocket path).
:If 0=⎕NC'null'
    init 'lib/'
:EndIf
req←{0::⍺,' - FAILED: ',⎕DMX.Message ⋄ ⍵:⍺,' - OK' ⋄ ⍺,' - FAILED'}
r←⊂'Test Export Arrow Bytes'

:If 3≠api.⎕NC'duckdb_export_query_arrow_ipc_buffer'
    r,←⊂'duckdb_export_query_arrow_ipc_buffer binding'req 0
    ⎕←↑r
    →0
:EndIf

db←open':memory:'
con←connect db

bytes rows←exportArrowBytes con 'SELECT i AS value, i*2 AS doubled FROM range(500) t(i)'
r,←⊂'exportArrowBytes row count'req 500=rows
r,←⊂'exportArrowBytes byte payload'req 1000<≢bytes

disconnect con
close db

r,←⊂''
r,←⊂'Export Arrow bytes smoke test complete!'
⎕←↑r
